cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "Gamma-Explorer: cross-domain CREP Gamma = arctanh(eta)/sigma comparison frame"
abstract: >
  Interactive explorer comparing the GenesisAeon CREP inversion
  Gamma = arctanh(eta)/sigma across ten published domain calibrations
  (AMOC, Amazon, solar flares, Cygnus X-1 jet, neural avalanches,
  BTW/Manna sandpiles, cellular metabolism, diffusive routing, Hikari
  PoR consensus). Every eta/Gamma value is copied from its source
  package's own published constant, not invented. Explicitly framed as
  a comparison coordinate system, not a claim of a universal physical
  constant -- see each domain's own caveat text in the app.
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-04"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GenesisAeon/gamma-explorer"
keywords:
  - CREP
  - UTAC
  - Gamma
  - tipping point
  - cross-domain comparison
  - GenesisAeon
